  <name>SSH File Explorer</name>
  <summary>Browse and manage remote Linux files over SSH</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      A native desktop app for browsing and managing files on remote Linux
      machines over SSH. Connect with a password or key, then upload, download,
      copy, paste, rename, and edit files as if they were local.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Interactive file browser with search, breadcrumbs, and multi-select</li>
      <li>Uploads, downloads, and copy/paste with real-time progress</li>
      <li>Sudo support with automatic retry for protected files</li>
      <li>Built-in text editor with syntax highlighting</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.jpognibene.SshFileExplorer.desktop</launchable>

